# {{ repo_slug }}

Agent product/capability repository generated from its owning company's L1 template.

## Authority boundary

This repository owns its agent persona, prompts, code, tests, and release artifacts. It does not appoint the agent to an organizational role or grant company delegation. Organizational delegation must be accepted in AK/governance state and is interpreted through `AGENTS.md`.

## Generated surfaces

- `docs/person/` — persona and behavior contract;
- `prompts/activities/` — owner-local activity prompts;
- `docs/decisions/` and `docs/learnings/` — narrative decisions and learning;
- `governance/task-scopes/` — optional frozen AK task-scope exports;
- `policy/do-not-touch.md` — safety guardrails;
- `scripts/ci/` — deterministic validation.



